      "statement": "policy-upper-bound: POLICY, not T1: the product caps the run at 128 bytes; an over-cap run is rejected whole, never truncated (Not a provider fact, and the provider gate is open-ended: positives reach 128 and no fixture asserts silence on 129.)",
