      "statement": "boundary: a key glued to an identifier on either side ([A-Za-z0-9_-]) is not claimed; a _ or - glued after the run rejects the match (The two provider rules agree on _ and disagree on -; the handoff decides both, so this is a handoff boundary decision, not a provider statement.)",
